sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Reviewer
  participant UI as Reviews tab
  participant URL as URL state
  participant Chat as Thread / Inbox
  participant SDK as LangGraph SDK
  participant Server as LangGraph server

  Reviewer->>UI: Open Operations → Reviews
  UI->>SDK: threads.search({ status: "interrupted" })
  SDK->>Server: POST /threads/search
  Server-->>SDK: Interrupted threads + interrupt actions
  SDK-->>UI: Review queue

  Reviewer->>UI: Click Review
  UI->>URL: set threadId, close operations
  URL-->>Chat: Load selected thread
  Chat->>SDK: Load history and pending interrupt
  SDK->>Server: GET /threads/{id}/history
  Server-->>Chat: Interrupt payload
  Chat-->>Reviewer: Render action review

  Reviewer->>Chat: Approve / Reject / Edit
  Chat->>SDK: Submit decision and resume
  SDK->>Server: Resume run
  Server-->>Chat: Run continues
  Chat-->>Reviewer: Updated thread state
